"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_4402614129953209_2802117275362406106_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vcxruiaYnXIQ7kNvwHnPGjN&_nc_oc=AdrY2yIWglKxeF2WFdzEpYU2VmXeTFV_is1GsJIF913NNOFJ418ASB9bruWcrF29c2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4BC70pJzXokXEqRTxluBNt3K-24wugNA8-8CXL0VfXg&oe=6AFC72F0"}, "display_name": "Warden of the Isles", "keywords": ["RTS", "Strategy", "Defense", "Tower", "Grab"], "long_description": "About This Game\nUse wits, magic, and a powerful throwing arm to build and defend your town while commanding troops in this lighthearted VR blend of RTS and Mage Simulator. Uncover a mysterious threat's dark origins and become... The Warden of the Isles!\n\nFeatures:\nA FULLY IMMERSIVE VR BLEND OF RTS AND MAGE SIMULATOR!\nWIELD A WARDEN'S POWER \u2014 Cast spells to sway battles, support troops, and summon elemental creatures.\nA MIGHTY THROWING ARM \u2014 Grab enemies and hurl them to their doom in the sea or against the earth, or rescue your own troops from foes!\nBUILD YOUR BASE \u2014 Assign workers, gather resources, construct buildings, and grow your army and defenses.\nLEAD TROOPS TO BATTLE \u2014 Organize unique legions and take the fight to the enemy!\nORIGINAL STORY \u2014 A fully voiced narrative with over 15 hours of gameplay.\n\nStory\nThere has always been a Warden of the Isles \u2014 powerful mages who defended the Isles of Muhan and kept peace between bickering tribes. By fusing with the Shards of Challenging, Wardens wield immense magical and physical power.\nOver time, the inhabitants grew ever more reliant on Wardens, even as those gifted enough to become one grew rarer.\nNow a dark rumor spreads... NEROK, the current Warden, has not been seen in months. Whispers say he has vanished. Strange occurrences across the Isles have drawn NAMURF, the former Warden, out of retirement to seek answers.\nBut he cannot do this alone... YOU have been chosen.", "short_description": "Use wits, magic, and a powerful throwing arm to build and defend your town while commanding troops to fight enemies in this lighthearted VR blend of RTS and Mage Simulator. Defend against a looming and mysterious threat, uncover its dark origins, and become... The Warden of the Isles!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beardlings.com/privacy-policy/warden-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Beardlings LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://beardlings.com/warden-of-the-isles", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26584721904488573"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1700028938412079"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1818182129307082"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1644198780534781"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2931170703883299"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1661907651575388"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1669886070974231"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1818182129307082"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794254400, "status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1700028938412079"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28691163253844417", "version":